:"2026-09-13T18:55:04Z","body":"### Fixed\r\n\r\n* Fix attribute insertion on enums and enum cases in formatting-preserving pretty printer.\r\n* Reject invalid Unicode escapes above `\\u{10FFFF}`. Previously the limit was `\\u{1FFFFF}`.\r\n* Don't allow newlines in `(void)` cast emulation.\r\n* Fix warning on float hex/binary/octal literals with PHP 8.6.\r\n\r\n### Added\r\n\r\n* Added support for PHP 8.6 partial function application. Placeholders are represented using `ArgPlaceholder` nodes.","is_prerelease":false},"readme":true,"readme_zh":false,"news":[],"stale":false,"snapshot_at":"2026-11-14T08:50:43Z","history_start":"2026-09-06"}